;; Whole-table cap fixture (tests/api-tests.sh runs this under a tiny
;; SLOG_MPZ_TABLE_BYTES): the computed bignum cannot intern, so the run
;; converges with an (error (mpz_table_overflow ...)) fact and no big row.
;; Computed (not literal) on purpose: a cap-tripped LITERAL fatals at load.

table (go int)
table (big int)

facts
(go 100000000)

rule (go X) (= R (* X X)) --> (big R)
